WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:07.526
Ooh! You're pretty!

2
00:00:08.197 --> 00:00:09.905
Who are you?

3
00:00:10.655 --> 00:00:12.844
I'm a jellyfish.

4
00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:16.703
We are invertebrate animals.

5
00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:21.677
That means we have no backbone.

6
00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:24.409
Where do you live?

7
00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:28.248
We live in oceans all over the world.

8
00:00:29.027 --> 00:00:33.196
We like both deep and shallow water.

9
00:00:33.876 --> 00:00:36.258
What do jellyfish eat?

10
00:00:37.335 --> 00:00:41.120
We eat fish, plankton, crabs, and shrimp.

11
00:00:41.773 --> 00:00:44.860
We use our tentacles to capture prey.

12
00:00:45.381 --> 00:00:47.846
Your tentacles are cool!

13
00:00:48.538 --> 00:00:51.277
Our tentacles have venom.

14
00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:56.465
We use it to sting our enemies!

15
00:00:56.788 --> 00:01:00.656
Yikes! Who are your enemies?

16
00:01:01.137 --> 00:01:03.718
Sea turtles like to eat us.

17
00:01:04.762 --> 00:01:07.375
Humans can harm us too.

18
00:01:07.855 --> 00:01:10.043
They use us for medicine.

19
00:01:10.681 --> 00:01:13.322
Do you ever sting humans?

20
00:01:14.412 --> 00:01:17.189
Some jellyfish do sting people.

21
00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:20.662
And their sting can be dangerous.

22
00:01:21.705 --> 00:01:24.782
But most jellyfish leave people alone.

23
00:01:25.266 --> 00:01:28.070
Do jellyfish swim well?

24
00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.764
No. We mostly float in the ocean.

25
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.436
But we can move on our own.

26
00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:36.990
Watch this!

27
00:01:42.401 --> 00:01:44.391
Here comes a wave.

28
00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.826
Watch me float away!

29
00:01:48.454 --> 00:01:50.519
Good-bye, Jellyfish!

